<title>INDIA: INDIA-STCI two-way quotes on securities - Aug 1.</title>
<headline>INDIA-STCI two-way quotes on securities - Aug 1.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Securities Trading Corporation</p>
<p>of</p>
<p>India (STCI) on Friday announced its two-way quotes for dated</p>
<p>government securities and treasury bills</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>	  Indicative opening quotes for govt securities</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>GOI DATED SECURITIES			  PRICES (in rupees)</p>
<p>--------------------			  Bid	     Offer</p>
<p>12.14% GoI stock, 2000		    104.32	   104.42</p>
<p>10.85% GoI stock, 2001		    100.77	   100.83</p>
<p>11.83% GoI stock, 2003		    102.78	   102.88</p>
<p>12.59% GoI stock, 2004		    105.82	   105.97</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>TREASURY BILLS</p>
<p>---------------</p>
<p>Maturities					   Yield pct p.a</p>
<p>						    Bid	     Offer</p>
<p>27/09/98					  6.80	     6.30</p>
<p>18/07/98					  8.15	     7.85</p>
